    "body": "Can you outline the case in more detail? Generally the reason we don't export these sorts of things is to [prevent monkey patching](https://w3ctag.github.io/design-principles/#monkey-patching). So e.g. it might be the case that you should be modifying the HTML spec to reference something it needs to run in the FedCM spec at load time instead.",
